{"ref":"BDB, מַחְסֶה","hw":"מַחְסֶה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֶה</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>Pr 14:26</sup> <strong>refuge, shelter</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲסֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:2\" href=\"/Psalms.46.2\">ψ 46:2</a> + 2 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">Is 28:17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:8\" href=\"/Psalms.62.8\">ψ 62:8</a> + 5 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחֲסִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 71:7\" href=\"/Psalms.71.7\">ψ 71:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 17:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.17.17\">Je 17:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 14:6\" href=\"/Psalms.14.6\">ψ 14:6</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מַחְסֵּנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a>;—<em>shelter:</em><br><strong>a.</strong>  from rain and storm <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.6\">Is 4:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 24:8\" href=\"/Job.24.8\">Jb 24:8</a>.<br><strong>b.</strong>  from danger <span dir=\"rtl\">סְלָעִים מַחְסֶּה לַשְׁפַנִּים</span> <em>rocks a refuge for conies</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:18\" href=\"/Psalms.104.18\">ψ 104:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מחסה כזב</span> <em>refuge of falsehood</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.17\">Is 28:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כזב מחסנוּ</span> <em>falsehood our refuge</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.15\">Is 28:15</a>; elsewhere of God as the refuge of his people <a data-ref=\"Psalms 14:6\" href=\"/Psalms.14.6\">ψ 14:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:2\" href=\"/Psalms.46.2\">46:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:4\" href=\"/Psalms.61.4\">61:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:8\" href=\"/Psalms.62.8\">62:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:9\" href=\"/Psalms.62.9\">9</a>; <a data